  "releaseNotes": "Initial release of CodingConnected.WPF.TileCanvas\n    \nFeatures:\n- Interactive drag and drop panels\n- Resizable panels with grid snapping\n- Two grid modes: Fixed and Flexible\n- Full MVVM support with data binding\n- Layout persistence (save/load to JSON)\n- Customizable styling and templates\n- Edit mode toggle\n- Event system for layout changes",
